DTSTAMP:20260814T171701Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260817
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260818
SUMMARY:[MAJOR] ECC - [ACTION] Call ECC Student Life re: Fall 2026 Week of 
 Welcome dates
LOCATION:Phone / email
DESCRIPTION:SCALE: MAJOR\n\nECC has published NO Fall 2026 welcome week sch
 edule and has zero events on its calendar dated on or after Sep 1\, 2026. 
 It posts events roughly 2-5 weeks out\; the September batch should appear 
 mid-to-late August. ECC does run a 'Week of Welcome' - one ran May 11-15\,
  2026 for the summer term - so a fall equivalent is likely in the week of 
 Sep 2-11.\n\nOUTREACH NOTE: Office of Student Life & Activities\, Clara Da
 sher Student Center Room 107\, 303 University Ave\, Newark NJ 07102. Phone
  973-877-3208. Director: Jamil Graham. NSO office: 973-877-4477. Ask for W
 eek of Welcome dates and whether external orgs can table at the Student Re
 source Fair or Club Fair (historic venues: 2nd Floor Forum in Newark\, WEC
  Hall at West Essex).\n\nSOURCE: https://www.essex.edu/studentlife/\n\n(Co
 mpiled 2026-08-10. Verify before acting.)
CATEGORIES:ECC\,MAJOR
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
