 (generated 12:07pm that day) shows the newest post at 2026-07-27. Nothing 
 posted in 14 days\; zero September-or-later events exist. The WP REST API 
 confirms independently. Given the 2-5 week lead pattern\, the September ba
 tch should land the week of Aug 17-24.\n\nOUTREACH NOTE: ACTION: recheck t
 he sitemap - it is the fastest single indicator. Then call Student Life\, 
 973-877-3208.\n\nSOURCE: https://www.essex.edu/mec-events-sitemap.xml\n\n(
