SUMMARY:[minor] ECC - Fall Resource Fair - precedent\, no 2026 date
LOCATION:2nd Floor Forum\, Essex County College\, Newark
DESCRIPTION:SCALE: minor\n\nPRECEDENT ONLY\, NOT A CONFIRMED 2026 EVENT. EC
 C's news archive shows 'ECC Hosts Fall Resource Fair with 30+ Community Pa
 rtners' posted 2025-10-28\, held in the 2nd Floor Forum. This confirms the
  venue and a late-October slot. Two other recurring events also have no sc
 heduled 2026 instances: the Spring Job Fair and the Club Fair.\n\nOUTREACH
  NOTE: 30+ community partners means ECC's resource fair genuinely admits e
 xternal organizations - the most open fair of the seven schools. Confirm t
 he 2026 date with Jamil Graham\, 973-877-3208.\n\nSOURCE: https://www.esse
 x.edu/\n\n(Compiled 2026-08-10. Verify before acting.)
CATEGORIES:ECC\,minor
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
